  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kyfdg62/high-res-Logo-Banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PWVBYYX/highres-Divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"51\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>🕮 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組靈感來自 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/vectorwing/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">vectorwing 的</span></a>「<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>」模組，新增許多方塊來裝點您的廚房。雖然搭配 Farmer's Delight 模組體驗更佳，但本模組也可獨立運作。Decoration Delight 新增了檯面、馬賽克、地磚、功能性方塊（水槽、垃圾桶）以及其他多樣的裝飾品，後續章節將詳細介紹。我計畫未來加入更多內容，敬請期待！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">感謝 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/vectorwing/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">vectorwing</span></a> 提供貼圖素材，強烈推薦大家一併體驗 Farmer's Delight 以及他的其他作品。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PWVBYYX/highres-Divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"51\"></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong>★</strong> 新增內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">以下是本模組新增的方塊與物品。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>➤ 地磚：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">地磚可透過對應方塊製成，是裝飾廚房或建築的絕佳選擇！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qRQTDRg/high-res-tile-Banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>➤ 馬賽克：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">精緻打造的馬賽克，能為任何空間增添生機！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rHkYxYd/high-res-mosaic-Banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>➤ 檯面、檯角、檯彎與檯面板：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">利用這些時尚的檯面儲存物品，並盡情在上面烹飪吧！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/BV0td5z/high-res-counter-Banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>➤ 凳子：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">凳子是廚房的完美配備，讓您能安心坐下休息！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qnH9bpN/high-res-stool-Banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>➤ 垃圾桶與水槽：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用垃圾桶輕鬆丟棄雜物，並從水槽接取新鮮水來裝滿水桶或瓶子吧！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Jp99Q3V/high-res-sink-trash-Banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"405\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PWVBYYX/highres-Divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"51\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">☺</span> 結語：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">非常感謝您下載我的模組並支持其開發。我為此投入了大量心血，真心感謝每一位玩家&nbsp;<strong>♡</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">也歡迎在留言區提出您的建議，若我覺得想法不錯就會實裝進遊戲中（例如水槽就是聽取建議後加入的）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>- <strong>InfernoSakai&nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PWVBYYX/highres-Divider.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"51\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
